{"seq":4,"slug":"ui-optimization","title":"UI 性能优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/unity-development/unity-ui/ui-optimization","wordCount":1112,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"ui-性能优化\">UI 性能优化</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>UI 渲染在许多游戏项目中占据了相当比例的性能开销。UGUI 的 Canvas 系统在元素发生变化时会触发 Mesh 重建（Rebuild），这个过程涉及布局计算、顶点生成和批次合并，是 UI 性能瓶颈的主要来源。理解 Canvas 的更新机制和批处理规则，是优化 UI 性能的前提。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph Canvas 更新流程&#10;        A[UI 元素变化] --&gt; B{变化类型}&#10;        B --&gt;|几何变化| C[Mesh 重建]&#10;        B --&gt;|材质变化| D[材质重组]&#10;        C --&gt; E[布局计算]&#10;        E --&gt; F[顶点生成]&#10;        F --&gt; G[批次合并]&#10;        G --&gt; H[GPU 渲染]&#10;        D --&gt; G&#10;    end&#10;    I[脏标记系统] --&gt; A\">graph TD\n    subgraph Canvas 更新流程\n        A[UI 元素变化] --&gt; B{变化类型}\n        B --&gt;|几何变化| C[Mesh 重建]\n        B --&gt;|材质变化| D[材质重组]\n        C --&gt; E[布局计算]\n        E --&gt; F[顶点生成]\n        F --&gt; G[批次合并]\n        G --&gt; H[GPU 渲染]\n        D --&gt; G\n    end\n    I[脏标记系统] --&gt; A</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>性能瓶颈</th>\n<th>产生原因</th>\n<th>影响程度</th>\n<th>检测方式</th>\n<th>优化策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Canvas Rebuild</td>\n<td>UI 元素位置/尺寸变化</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>Profiler UI 模块</td>\n<td>分离动静 Canvas</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Overdraw</td>\n<td>UI 元素重叠绘制</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>Scene 视图 Overdraw 模式</td>\n<td>减少透明层叠</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Draw Call</td>\n<td>材质/纹理不同导致批次断裂</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>Frame Debugger</td>\n<td>图集合并</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Layout 计算</td>\n<td>LayoutGroup 频繁重算</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>Profiler</td>\n<td>减少嵌套布局</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Raycast 检测</td>\n<td>不必要的射线检测</td>\n<td>低-中</td>\n<td>Profiler</td>\n<td>禁用不需交互的 Raycast</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GC 分配</td>\n<td>字符串拼接、频繁创建</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>Profiler Memory</td>\n<td>对象池 + StringBuilder</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"canvas-分离与动静分层\">Canvas 分离与动静分层</h2><p>Canvas Rebuild 的核心规则是：一个 Canvas 内任何元素发生变化，整个 Canvas 的所有元素都需要重新计算。因此，将频繁变化的 UI（血条、计时器、伤害数字）和静态 UI（背景、边框、标题）分离到不同的 Canvas 中，是最重要的优化手段。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"using UnityEngine;&#10;using UnityEngine.UI;&#10;&#10;public class OptimizedHUD : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    [Header(&quot;静态 Canvas（几乎不变化）&quot;)]&#10;    [SerializeField] private Canvas staticCanvas;&#10;&#10;    [Header(&quot;动态 Canvas（每帧更新）&quot;)]&#10;    [SerializeField] private Canvas dynamicCanvas;&#10;&#10;    [Header(&quot;动态元素&quot;)]&#10;    [SerializeField] private Slider healthSlider;&#10;    [SerializeField] private Text ammoText;&#10;    [SerializeField] private Text timerText;&#10;&#10;    private int lastAmmo = -1;&#10;    private float displayedHealth = -1f;&#10;&#10;    public void UpdateHealth(float normalized)&#10;    {&#10;        if (Mathf.Approximately(displayedHealth, normalized)) return;&#10;        displayedHealth = normalized;&#10;        healthSlider.value = normalized;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public void UpdateAmmo(int current)&#10;    {&#10;        if (current == lastAmmo) return;&#10;        lastAmmo = current;&#10;        ammoText.text = current.ToString();&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public void UpdateTimer(float seconds)&#10;    {&#10;        int minutes = (int)(seconds / 60f);&#10;        int secs = (int)(seconds % 60f);&#10;        timerText.text = $&quot;{minutes:D2}:{secs:D2}&quot;;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine.UI;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class OptimizedHUD : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [Header(\"静态 Canvas（几乎不变化）\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private Canvas staticCanvas;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [Header(\"动态 Canvas（每帧更新）\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private Canvas dynamicCanvas;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [Header(\"动态元素\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private Slider healthSlider;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private Text ammoText;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private Text timerText;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private int lastAmmo = -1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private float displayedHealth = -1f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void UpdateHealth(float normalized)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (Mathf.Approximately(displayedHealth, normalized)) return;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        displayedHealth = normalized;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        healthSlider.value = normalized;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void UpdateAmmo(int current)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (current == lastAmmo) return;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        lastAmmo = current;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ammoText.text = current.ToString();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void UpdateTimer(float seconds)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        int minutes = (int)(seconds / 60f);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        int secs = (int)(seconds % 60f);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        timerText.text = $\"{minutes:D2}:{secs:D2}\";</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 分层 Canvas 架构&#10;        A[Root Canvas - Overlay] --&gt; B[Static Canvas 静态层]&#10;        A --&gt; C[Dynamic Canvas 动态层]&#10;        A --&gt; D[Popup Canvas 弹窗层]&#10;        B --&gt; E[背景框架]&#10;        B --&gt; F[按钮图标]&#10;        C --&gt; G[血条]&#10;        C --&gt; H[计时器]&#10;        C --&gt; I[弹药数]&#10;        D --&gt; J[对话框]&#10;        D --&gt; K[提示信息]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 分层 Canvas 架构\n        A[Root Canvas - Overlay] --&gt; B[Static Canvas 静态层]\n        A --&gt; C[Dynamic Canvas 动态层]\n        A --&gt; D[Popup Canvas 弹窗层]\n        B --&gt; E[背景框架]\n        B --&gt; F[按钮图标]\n        C --&gt; G[血条]\n        C --&gt; H[计时器]\n        C --&gt; I[弹药数]\n        D --&gt; J[对话框]\n        D --&gt; K[提示信息]\n    end</pre><p>嵌套 Canvas（子 Canvas）是实现分层的另一种方式。子 Canvas 拥有独立的 Rebuild 范围，子 Canvas 内的变化不会触发父 Canvas 的重建。但需要注意子 Canvas 会打断父 Canvas 的批处理。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分层策略</th>\n<th>实现方式</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>多根 Canvas</td>\n<td>多个顶级 Canvas</td>\n<td>完全隔离</td>\n<td>排序管理复杂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>子 Canvas</td>\n<td>嵌套 Canvas 组件</td>\n<td>简单直观</td>\n<td>打断父级批处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按更新频率分组</td>\n<td>同频率放同 Canvas</td>\n<td>精准控制</td>\n<td>需要预判更新频率</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"批处理与图集优化\">批处理与图集优化</h2><p>UGUI 的渲染器会尝试将相邻的、使用相同材质和纹理的 UI 元素合并为一个 Draw Call。但当元素的材质、纹理、裁剪矩形不同，或元素在层级中交叉排列时，批处理会被打断。</p>\n<p>Sprite Atlas（图集）将多张小图合并为一张大纹理，让使用不同精灵的 UI 元素可以合批渲染：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"using UnityEngine;&#10;using UnityEngine.U2D;&#10;&#10;public class AtlasManager : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    [SerializeField] private SpriteAtlas uiAtlas;&#10;&#10;    private void OnEnable()&#10;    {&#10;        SpriteAtlasManager.atlasRequested += OnAtlasRequested;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void OnDisable()&#10;    {&#10;        SpriteAtlasManager.atlasRequested -= OnAtlasRequested;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void OnAtlasRequested(string tag, System.Action&lt;SpriteAtlas&gt; callback)&#10;    {&#10;        if (tag == &quot;UIAtlas&quot;)&#10;        {&#10;            callback(uiAtlas);&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public Sprite GetSprite(string spriteName)&#10;    {&#10;        return uiAtlas.GetSprite(spriteName);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine.U2D;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class AtlasManager : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private SpriteAtlas uiAtlas;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void OnEnable()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        SpriteAtlasManager.atlasRequested += OnAtlasRequested;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void OnDisable()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        SpriteAtlasManager.atlasRequested -= OnAtlasRequested;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void OnAtlasRequested(string tag, System.Action&#x3C;SpriteAtlas> callback)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (tag == \"UIAtlas\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            callback(uiAtlas);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public Sprite GetSprite(string spriteName)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return uiAtlas.GetSprite(spriteName);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>批处理打断的常见原因和解决方案：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>打断原因</th>\n<th>现象</th>\n<th>解决方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>不同纹理</td>\n<td>交替使用不同图片</td>\n<td>合并到同一图集</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不同材质</td>\n<td>UI 使用自定义 Shader</td>\n<td>统一材质</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mask 组件</td>\n<td>引入额外 Stencil 操作</td>\n<td>改用 RectMask2D</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>层级交叉</td>\n<td>Image-Text-Image 交叉</td>\n<td>调整层级顺序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不同 Canvas</td>\n<td>跨 Canvas 无法合批</td>\n<td>合理分配 Canvas</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>通过 Frame Debugger（Window → Analysis → Frame Debugger）可以逐个查看每个 Draw Call 的合批情况，精准定位批处理断裂的位置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"raycast-优化\">Raycast 优化</h2><p>GraphicRaycaster 在每次点击或触摸时对 Canvas 内所有开启了 Raycast Target 的元素进行射线检测。默认情况下所有 Graphic 组件（Image、Text 等）的 Raycast Target 都是开启的，但实际上大部分纯显示元素不需要响应点击事件。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"using UnityEngine;&#10;using UnityEngine.UI;&#10;&#10;public class RaycastOptimizer : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    public void OptimizeCanvasRaycasts(Canvas canvas)&#10;    {&#10;        var graphics = canvas.GetComponentsInChildren&lt;Graphic&gt;(true);&#10;        int disabled = 0;&#10;&#10;        foreach (var graphic in graphics)&#10;        {&#10;            bool needsRaycast = graphic.GetComponent&lt;IEventSystemHandler&gt;() != null&#10;                || graphic.GetComponent&lt;Button&gt;() != null&#10;                || graphic.GetComponent&lt;Toggle&gt;() != null&#10;                || graphic.GetComponent&lt;Slider&gt;() != null&#10;                || graphic.GetComponent&lt;InputField&gt;() != null&#10;                || graphic.GetComponent&lt;ScrollRect&gt;() != null;&#10;&#10;            if (!needsRaycast &amp;&amp; graphic.raycastTarget)&#10;            {&#10;                graphic.raycastTarget = false;&#10;                disabled++;&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        Debug.Log($&quot;已禁用 {disabled}/{graphics.Length} 个不必要的 Raycast Target&quot;);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine.UI;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class RaycastOptimizer : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void OptimizeCanvasRaycasts(Canvas canvas)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var graphics = canvas.GetComponentsInChildren&#x3C;Graphic>(true);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        int disabled = 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        foreach (var graphic in graphics)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            bool needsRaycast = graphic.GetComponent&#x3C;IEventSystemHandler>() != null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                || graphic.GetComponent&#x3C;Button>() != null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                || graphic.GetComponent&#x3C;Toggle>() != null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                || graphic.GetComponent&#x3C;Slider>() != null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                || graphic.GetComponent&#x3C;InputField>() != null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                || graphic.GetComponent&#x3C;ScrollRect>() != null;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if (!needsRaycast &#x26;&#x26; graphic.raycastTarget)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                graphic.raycastTarget = false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                disabled++;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Debug.Log($\"已禁用 {disabled}/{graphics.Length} 个不必要的 Raycast Target\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>对于大量 UI 元素的场景（如背包格子），可以通过 RaycastPadding 缩小射线检测区域，或在父级使用一个大的透明 Image 作为统一的 Raycast 接收器，然后通过位置计算确定点击了哪个格子。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对象池与文本优化\">对象池与文本优化</h2><p>频繁创建和销毁 UI 元素（如伤害数字、飘字提示）会产生大量 GC 分配。对象池模式通过预创建和复用来消除运行时的实例化开销：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"using UnityEngine;&#10;using System.Collections.Generic;&#10;using UnityEngine.UI;&#10;&#10;public class DamageNumberPool : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    [SerializeField] private GameObject damageNumberPrefab;&#10;    [SerializeField] private Transform poolParent;&#10;    [SerializeField] private int initialPoolSize = 20;&#10;&#10;    private readonly Queue&lt;GameObject&gt; pool = new();&#10;&#10;    private void Awake()&#10;    {&#10;        for (int i = 0; i &lt; initialPoolSize; i++)&#10;        {&#10;            var go = Instantiate(damageNumberPrefab, poolParent);&#10;            go.SetActive(false);&#10;            pool.Enqueue(go);&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public GameObject Get(Vector3 worldPosition, int damage)&#10;    {&#10;        GameObject go;&#10;&#10;        if (pool.Count &gt; 0)&#10;        {&#10;            go = pool.Dequeue();&#10;        }&#10;        else&#10;        {&#10;            go = Instantiate(damageNumberPrefab, poolParent);&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        go.transform.position = worldPosition;&#10;        go.GetComponentInChildren&lt;Text&gt;().text = damage.ToString();&#10;        go.SetActive(true);&#10;        return go;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public void Return(GameObject go)&#10;    {&#10;        go.SetActive(false);&#10;        pool.Enqueue(go);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>using System.Collections.Generic;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine.UI;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class DamageNumberPool : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private GameObject damageNumberPrefab;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private Transform poolParent;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private int initialPoolSize = 20;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private readonly Queue&#x3C;GameObject> pool = new();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void Awake()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        for (int i = 0; i &#x3C; initialPoolSize; i++)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            var go = Instantiate(damageNumberPrefab, poolParent);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            go.SetActive(false);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            pool.Enqueue(go);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public GameObject Get(Vector3 worldPosition, int damage)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        GameObject go;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (pool.Count > 0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            go = pool.Dequeue();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        else</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            go = Instantiate(damageNumberPrefab, poolParent);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        go.transform.position = worldPosition;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        go.GetComponentInChildren&#x3C;Text>().text = damage.ToString();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        go.SetActive(true);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return go;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void Return(GameObject go)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        go.SetActive(false);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        pool.Enqueue(go);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>文本更新是另一个常见的性能陷阱。每次修改 Text 组件的 text 属性都会触发 Mesh 重建和字符串分配。避免在 Update 中无条件更新文本，只在值真正变化时才赋值：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"using UnityEngine;&#10;using UnityEngine.UI;&#10;using System.Text;&#10;&#10;public class OptimizedScoreDisplay : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    [SerializeField] private Text scoreText;&#10;    [SerializeField] private Text fpsText;&#10;&#10;    private int lastScore = -1;&#10;    private int lastFps = -1;&#10;    private readonly StringBuilder sb = new(16);&#10;    private float fpsUpdateInterval = 0.5f;&#10;    private float fpsTimer;&#10;&#10;    public void SetScore(int score)&#10;    {&#10;        if (score == lastScore) return;&#10;        lastScore = score;&#10;&#10;        sb.Clear();&#10;        sb.Append(&quot;Score: &quot;);&#10;        sb.Append(score);&#10;        scoreText.text = sb.ToString();&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void Update()&#10;    {&#10;        fpsTimer += Time.unscaledDeltaTime;&#10;        if (fpsTimer &lt; fpsUpdateInterval) return;&#10;        fpsTimer = 0f;&#10;&#10;        int fps = (int)(1f / Time.unscaledDeltaTime);&#10;        if (fps == lastFps) return;&#10;        lastFps = fps;&#10;&#10;        sb.Clear();&#10;        sb.Append(&quot;FPS: &quot;);&#10;        sb.Append(fps);&#10;        fpsText.text = sb.ToString();&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine.UI;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>using System.Text;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class OptimizedScoreDisplay : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private Text scoreText;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private Text fpsText;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private int lastScore = -1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private int lastFps = -1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private readonly StringBuilder sb = new(16);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private float fpsUpdateInterval = 0.5f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private float fpsTimer;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void SetScore(int score)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (score == lastScore) return;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        lastScore = score;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        sb.Clear();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        sb.Append(\"Score: \");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        sb.Append(score);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        scoreText.text = sb.ToString();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void Update()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        fpsTimer += Time.unscaledDeltaTime;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (fpsTimer &#x3C; fpsUpdateInterval) return;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        fpsTimer = 0f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        int fps = (int)(1f / Time.unscaledDeltaTime);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (fps == lastFps) return;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        lastFps = fps;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        sb.Clear();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        sb.Append(\"FPS: \");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        sb.Append(fps);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        fpsText.text = sb.ToString();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((UI 性能优化))&#10;    Canvas 分离&#10;      动静分层&#10;      子 Canvas 隔离&#10;      按更新频率分组&#10;    批处理优化&#10;      Sprite Atlas 图集&#10;      统一材质纹理&#10;      层级顺序调整&#10;      Frame Debugger 分析&#10;    Raycast 优化&#10;      禁用不必要的检测&#10;      统一接收器模式&#10;    对象池&#10;      预创建复用&#10;      消除运行时 GC&#10;    文本优化&#10;      变化检测避免冗余更新&#10;      StringBuilder 替代拼接\">mindmap\n  root((UI 性能优化))\n    Canvas 分离\n      动静分层\n      子 Canvas 隔离\n      按更新频率分组\n    批处理优化\n      Sprite Atlas 图集\n      统一材质纹理\n      层级顺序调整\n      Frame Debugger 分析\n    Raycast 优化\n      禁用不必要的检测\n      统一接收器模式\n    对象池\n      预创建复用\n      消除运行时 GC\n    文本优化\n      变化检测避免冗余更新\n      StringBuilder 替代拼接</pre><ul>\n<li>Canvas Rebuild 是 UI 性能的核心瓶颈，分离动态和静态元素到不同 Canvas 是最重要的优化</li>\n<li>Sprite Atlas 合并纹理减少 Draw Call，Frame Debugger 精准定位批处理断裂</li>\n<li>禁用纯显示元素的 Raycast Target 减少不必要的射线检测开销</li>\n<li>对象池模式消除 UI 元素频繁创建销毁的 GC 压力</li>\n<li>文本更新应做变化检测，使用 StringBuilder 替代字符串拼接减少内存分配</li>\n<li>子 Canvas 提供独立的 Rebuild 范围，但会打断父级的批处理合并</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"UI 性能优化","id":"ui-性能优化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Canvas 分离与动静分层","id":"canvas-分离与动静分层"},{"level":2,"text":"批处理与图集优化","id":"批处理与图集优化"},{"level":2,"text":"Raycast 优化","id":"raycast-优化"},{"level":2,"text":"对象池与文本优化","id":"对象池与文本优化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"UI 动画","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/unity-development/unity-ui/ui-animation"},"next":{"title":"性能分析工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/unity-development/unity-performance/profiling-tools"}}